    <string name="onboarding_start">Begin the Adventure</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_title">Welcome to your logbook, adventurer</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_body">This is not a to-do list. Here, everything you do in real life builds your character. Exercise, books, study, socialising… each one is a quest.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_title">You get three habit slots</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">You cannot add unlimited quests. You pick three habits, and each slot pays XP once per day. You choose the ability it trains: exercise feeds Strength, reading feeds Intelligence.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_title">The catalog is full of ready quests</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_body">For one-off efforts, open the in-app catalog: read an article, call someone, take a walk. You can repeat the same task on another day, but at most two catalog quests pay XP per day.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_4_title">Pathways test you</string>
    <string name="onboarding_4_body">A pathway is a long adventure made of stages. While you are on one, part of the XP you earn is held in escrow: finish it and the escrow plus a bonus is yours, abandon it and the escrow burns.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_5_title">Becoming a legend is not easy</string>
    <string name="onboarding_5_body">Every level grants feat choices, and your flame grows while you quest daily. Nobody has reached level 20 yet. Maybe you will be the first.</string>

